--Which product brought in the most revenue in January and how much revenue did it bring in total? In other words, show the one product that generated the most revenue (revenue being equivalent to quantity of an item multiplied by the item’s price). 
SELECT product, SUM(Quantity)*price AS revenue
FROM JanSales
GROUP BY product
ORDER BY SUM (quantity*price) desc
LIMIT 1; 

